            "value": "बैकअप में कोई कनेक्शन नहीं है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O bundle não contém o LaunchDaemon esperado. Use o app gerado por scripts/build.sh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Bundle enthält nicht den erwarteten LaunchDaemon. Verwende die von scripts/build.sh erstellte App."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bundle does not contain the expected LaunchDaemon. Use the app built by scripts/build.sh."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El bundle no contiene el LaunchDaemon esperado. Usa la app generada por scripts/build.sh."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bundle ne contient pas le LaunchDaemon attendu. Utilisez l’app générée par scripts/build.sh."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "bundle में अपेक्षित LaunchDaemon नहीं है। scripts/build.sh से बना ऐप उपयोग करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O cadastro, a senha salva e a sessão SAML guardada serão removidos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Verbindung, das gespeicherte Passwort und die gespeicherte SAML-Sitzung werden entfernt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection, the saved password and the stored SAML session will be removed."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se eliminarán la conexión, la contraseña guardada y la sesión SAML almacenada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La connexion, le mot de passe enregistré et la session SAML conservée seront supprimés."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कनेक्शन, सहेजा गया पासवर्ड और रखा गया SAML सत्र हटा दिए जाएँगे।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O caminho resolve para outro arquivo: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Pfad verweist auf eine andere Datei: %@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The path resolves to another file: %@"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La ruta apunta a otro archivo: %@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le chemin mène à un autre fichier : %@"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "पथ किसी दूसरी फ़ाइल की ओर जाता है: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O certificado confiável deve ter exatamente 64 caracteres hexadecimais (SHA-256).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das vertrauenswürdige Zertifikat muss genau 64 Hexadezimalzeichen haben (SHA-256)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The trusted certificate must have exactly 64 hexadecimal characters (SHA-256)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El certificado de confianza debe tener exactamente 64 caracteres hexadecimales (SHA-256)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le certificat de confiance doit comporter exactement 64 caractères hexadécimaux (SHA-256)."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "भरोसेमंद प्रमाणपत्र में ठीक 64 हेक्साडेसिमल वर्ण होने चाहिए (SHA-256)।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O certificado do cliente \"%@\" não foi encontrado no Keychain. Edite a conexão e escolha-o de novo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Client-Zertifikat „%@“ wurde nicht im Schlüsselbund gefunden. Bearbeite die Verbindung und wähle es erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Client certificate \"%@\" was not found in the Keychain. Edit the connection and choose it again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El certificado de cliente \"%@\" no se encontró en el llavero. Edita la conexión y vuelve a elegirlo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le certificat client « %@ » est introuvable dans le trousseau. Modifiez la connexion et choisissez-le de nouveau."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "क्लाइंट प्रमाणपत्र \"%@\" कीचेन में नहीं मिला। कनेक्शन संपादित करें और इसे फिर से चुनें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O certificado do gateway não foi validado pelo macOS. Confira o servidor ou informe o SHA-256 confiável.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS hat das Zertifikat des Gateways nicht bestätigt. Prüfe den Server oder gib den vertrauenswürdigen SHA-256 an."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS did not validate the gateway’s certificate. Check the server or enter the trusted SHA-256."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS no validó el certificado del gateway. Revisa el servidor o indica el SHA-256 de confianza."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS n’a pas validé le certificat de la passerelle. Vérifiez le serveur ou indiquez le SHA-256 approuvé."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS ने गेटवे का प्रमाणपत्र मान्य नहीं किया। सर्वर जाँचें या भरोसेमंद SHA-256 दर्ज करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O certificado do servidor precisa ser conferido": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Serverzertifikat muss geprüft werden"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server certificate needs to be checked"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hay que revisar el certificado del servidor"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le certificat du serveur doit être vérifié"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "सर्वर प्रमाणपत्र की जाँच आवश्यक है"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O certificado sugerido não está mais disponível.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das vorgeschlagene Zertifikat ist nicht mehr verfügbar."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The suggested certificate is no longer available."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El certificado sugerido ya no está disponible."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le certificat suggéré n’est plus disponible."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "सुझाया गया प्रमाणपत्र अब उपलब्ध नहीं है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O conteúdo do .zip passa de 4 MB; não parece um perfil OpenVPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Inhalt der .zip ist größer als 4 MB; sie sieht nicht wie ein OpenVPN-Profil aus."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The .zip’s content is over 4 MB; it does not look like an OpenVPN profile."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El contenido del .zip supera los 4 MB; no parece un perfil OpenVPN."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le contenu du .zip dépasse 4 Mo ; il ne ressemble pas à un profil OpenVPN."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ".zip की सामग्री 4 MB से अधिक है; यह OpenVPN प्रोफ़ाइल नहीं लगती।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O gateway GlobalProtect recusou o prelogin. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das GlobalProtect-Gateway hat den Prelogin abgelehnt. %@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The GlobalProtect gateway refused the prelogin. %@"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El gateway GlobalProtect rechazó el prelogin. %@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La passerelle GlobalProtect a refusé le prelogin. %@"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GlobalProtect गेटवे ने प्रीलॉगिन अस्वीकार कर दिया। %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O gateway GlobalProtect: vpn.exemplo.com ou vpn.exemplo.com:4443": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das GlobalProtect-Gateway: vpn.example.com oder vpn.example.com:4443"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
